botopink-snap 1
test: create: help ---- the flag table from the one defaults record
subject: help

usage: rakun-ssr create <name> [options]

  --port <n>              3000     written into rakun-ssr.json
  --[no-]src-dir          off      app/, components/ and lib/ under src/, or at the project root
  --emilia / --no-emilia  on       emilia tokens in the layout, or none
  --example <name>        (none)   copy examples/<name> instead of the scaffold
  --lang <tag>            en       the document's <html lang>, written into rakun-ssr.json
  --libs <dir>            (none)   depend on a rakun checkout (its modules/<package>) by path
  --yes                   off      take every default and skip the prompts
